==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Shibalien]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
*5 [[Kroxo]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 20~23.33 seconds<sup>600f~700f</sup>.
*2 [[Helmut Krabbe]]s spawn after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>, delay 26.67~30 seconds<sup>800f~900f</sup>.
*1 [[Maawth]] spawns after 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>.
*5 [[Mistress Celeboodle]]s spawn after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>, delay 20~23.33 seconds<sup>600f~700f</sup>.

==Strategy==
It you've collected the [[Anti-unstarred Alien Treasures]] from [[Into the Future]] Chapter 2, this level becomes a joke and is Labyrinth fodder.

